stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> InteractionRecorded: Service Execution Completes
    InteractionRecorded --> ResultVerified: Verification Module Assesses Output
    ResultVerified --> EvidenceConstructed: Format VerificationRecord & Metadata
    EvidenceConstructed --> LocalStorage: Write to Off-Chain Evidence Store
    EvidenceConstructed --> VectorIndex: Index Semantic Representation (RAG)
    EvidenceConstructed --> StateCommitment: Compute Merkle Root / SHA-256 Hash
    StateCommitment --> OnChainAnchor: Anchor Commitment to Blockchain Log
    
    LocalStorage --> TrustAssessment: Query During Future Service Discovery
    VectorIndex --> TrustAssessment: Retrieve Task-Relevant Historical Traces
    OnChainAnchor --> IntegrityCheck: Verify Provenance Before Critical Decision
    
    TrustAssessment --> DecisionMade: Select or Reject Candidate Service
    DecisionMade --> InteractionRecorded: New Task Executed (Continuous Feedback)
